==Description==
'''CHOMP''', is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]]. It is obtained from Level 7 of the regular track, which had a cost of {{BeachBalls|180}} or {{Robux|67}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|700}} or {{Robux|322}}. This item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|84}} with a total cost of {{Robux|406}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a cost of {{Robux|44}}, with a total cost of {{Robux|366}}.

==Appearance==
This sticker showcases the {{Color|Surf|Shark}} [[Scout]]'s head. A chomping sound can heard while using this sticker.

